OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Frather breezy this evening but staying
OL,7,Fdry. Cloud building from the southwest
OL,8,Fovernight, this thick enough to give
OL,9,Fthe odd spot of light rain and drizzle
OL,10,Fat times overnight. Rather windy in
OL,11,Fcoastal regions and remaining very
OL,12,Fmild.
OL,13,
OL,14,CThursday:FLargely cloudy and breezy
OL,15,Fwith some light showers but some
OL,16,Fbrightness is possible. Rain arriving
OL,17,Fin western areas later. A very mild
OL,18,Fday and feeling unseasonably warm in
OL,19,Fany sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
